        "markdown": "One mutation across every surface, mirroring the doc form exactly. Read\n`internal/cmd/docreviewers.go` and `store.SetDocReviewers`\n(`internal/store/approvals.go`) first: the doc side is `lode doc reviewers\n\u003cref\u003e` to view and `lode doc set reviewers \u003cactor…\u003e \u003cref\u003e` to write, and\nthe task side copies both."
      },
      "range": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 307
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "",
      "type": "source",
      "props": {
